{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53422","headline":"夜 · 林藻","name":"夜","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"久绝白云信，愁心如水长。\n蛩鸣万户月，鸦步一溪霜。\n不识红尘险，安知皓首狂。\n捣衣中夜望，今古事寻常。\n（《莆风清籁集》卷一）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"林藻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53422.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53422","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}